          "to": "ҡом",
          "note": "Volga Kipchak lowered Proto-Turkic *u to o; Turkmen keeps u (gum, guş, gul)."
        },
        {
          "from": "Proto-Turkic *kuš 'bird'",
          "to": "ҡош"
